    "Id": "mechdef_timber_wolf_TW-P",
    "Name": "Timber Wolf P",
    "Details": "The <i>Timber Wolf</i> OmniMech was code-named \"Mad Cat\" by the Inner Sphere during the Clan Invasion. Although perhaps more accurate would be to say that it was named by the Inner Sphere's targeting systems. Confused by the silhouette of an unknown 'Mech, systems would alternate between designating it as a <i>Marauder</i>, MAD, or a <i>Catapult</i>, CAT, giving rise to the name.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Combat Computer</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.13</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "NotMadCat"
  },
